Implement user story SKY-002: Implement typed Skyscanner API client

## Story Description
Create src/skyscanner/client.ts that wraps the Skyscanner RapidAPI with typed interfaces, constructor-based apiKey handling, global fetch-based searchFlights, error handling, and opt-in mock mode. Create src/skyscanner/client.test.ts with vitest tests mocking global fetch.

## Acceptance Criteria
- SkyscannerClient class, SearchParams interface, and FlightResult interface are exported from src/skyscanner/client.ts
- searchFlights method uses global fetch with proper error handling and opt-in mock mode via MOCK_SKYSCANNER_API env var
- src/skyscanner/client.test.ts covers all client behaviors with mocked fetch — no real network calls
- tsc --noEmit exits 0 and vitest run exits 0





